    <s:String x:Key="S_Routing_ReadOnly">This profile comes from a subscription and the next fetch overwrites it, so it cannot be changed. Right-click and pick Duplicate — the copy is yours.</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="S_Ping_Moon">Moon Ping is a latency test in which the TCP connection to the server is established outside the active tunnel, giving the latency to the server itself rather than to the VPN connection.</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="S_Ping_Tcp">TCP ping is a network latency test that measures the time required to establish a full TCP connection with the target server.</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="S_Ping_HttpGet">HTTP GET is a network latency test in which an HTTP request is sent to the server and the time to the first byte of the response is measured.</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="S_Ping_HttpHead">HTTP HEAD is a network latency test in which the server is asked for headers only, without a response body, reducing the data transferred for the same measurement.</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="S_Ping_Stability">Stability is a connection test in which a full connection is established over the selected protocol and a request is made through it, confirming that the protocol itself works rather than only that the port is reachable.</s:String>
